{"id": "gpt-phone-numbers-16", "category": "phone-numbers", "difficulty": "hard", "description": "A dial prefix name: 2 through 12 Unicode letter clusters. Each cluster is a Unicode letter followed by zero to two Unicode combining marks. One optional ASCII hyphen may join two nonempty runs of clusters, but no edge hyphen or second hyphen is allowed. Length counts letter clusters, excluding the hyphen and any fixed prefix; spaces, digits and other characters are forbidden. No normalization is performed. Append the exact literal suffix :0000 after the name; its characters do not count toward the cluster limit.", "regex": "/^(?=(?:\\p{L}\\p{M}{0,2}-?){2,12}:0000$)(?:\\p{L}\\p{M}{0,2}){1,12}(?:-(?:\\p{L}\\p{M}{0,2}){1,12})?:0000$(?![\\s\\S])/u", "tests": {"match": ["ab:0000", "éx:0000", "á̈b:0000", "東京-大阪:0000", "Δέλτα:0000", "مرحبا:0000", "Зима:0000", "abcdefghijkl:0000", "é-ë:0000", "Aé:0000"], "no_match": ["a:0000", "abcdefghijklm:0000", "ab1:0000", "a_b:0000", "a b:0000", "é:0000", "😀a:0000", "́ab:0000", "á̈̃b:0000", "-ab:0000", "ab-:0000", "a--b:0000", "ab-cd-ef:0000", "ab", "ab?0000", "!ab:0000", "ab:0000!", "ab:0000\n", "ab:0000\r", "ab:0000\r\n", "ab:0000 ", "ab:0000 ", " ab:0000", "ab:0000 "]}}
