{"id": "gpt-postal-official-17", "category": "postal-official", "difficulty": "hard", "description": "An official record memo: the entire string has the literal opening wrapper DOC{, a lowercase ASCII routing label of 2 through 6 letters, colon, a body, colon, the exact same routing label and the literal closing wrapper }DOC. The body has 1 through 40 Unicode code points, allows any characters including line breaks and colons, and must contain the lowercase substring filed. Only the body counts toward its length limit; no other text is allowed.", "regex": "/^DOC\\{(?<route>[a-z]{2,6}):(?=.{1,40}:\\k<route>\\}DOC$)(?=.{0,40}filed.{0,40}:\\k<route>\\}DOC$).*:\\k<route>\\}DOC$(?![\\s\\S])/su", "tests": {"match": ["DOC{abcdef:afiled:abcdef}DOC", "DOC{tag:filedb:tag}DOC", "DOC{route:\nfiled:route}DOC", "DOC{memo:filed\n:memo}DOC", "DOC{ab:\tfiled:ab}DOC", "DOC{zz:😀filed:zz}DOC", "DOC{key:xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxfiled:key}DOC", "DOC{xy:😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀filed:xy}DOC", "DOC{aa:prefix: filed: suffix:aa}DOC"], "no_match": ["DOC{aa::aa}DOC", "DOC{aa:abc:aa}DOC", "DOC{aa:xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxfiled:aa}DOC", "DOC{aa:filed:ab}DOC", "DOC{a:filed:a}DOC", "DOC{abcdefg:filed:abcdefg}DOC", "DOC{AA:filed:AA}DOC", "DOC{aa:FILED:aa}DOC", "DOC{aa:filed:aa", "aa:filed:aa}DOC", "DOC{aa:😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀😀filed:aa}DOC", "DOC{filed:abc:filed}DOC", "!DOC{aa:filed:aa}DOC", "DOC{aa:filed:aa}DOC!", "DOC{aa:filed:aa}DOC\n", "DOC{aa:filed:aa}DOC\r", "DOC{aa:filed:aa}DOC\r\n", "DOC{aa:filed:aa}DOC ", "DOC{aa:filed:aa}DOC ", " DOC{aa:filed:aa}DOC", "DOC{aa:filed:aa}DOC "]}, "examples": {"match": ["DOC{aa:filed:aa}DOC"], "no_match": []}}
{"id": "gpt-structured-data-14", "category": "structured-data", "difficulty": "hard", "description": "A duplicate-field record is value: and two identical lowercase ASCII words 3 to 8 letters separated by slash. No spaces or other fields. Each of the two values must be enclosed in matching ASCII single or double quotes; the same quote character must be used for both values. Quotes are not part of the value, and escapes are not permitted.", "regex": "/^value:(['\\\"])([a-z]{3,8})\\1\\/\\1\\2\\1$(?![\\s\\S])/", "tests": {"match": ["value:'abc'/'abc'", "value:\"xyz\"/\"xyz\"", "value:'abcdefgh'/'abcdefgh'", "value:\"field\"/\"field\"", "value:'value'/'value'", "value:\"token\"/\"token\"", "value:'sample'/'sample'", "value:\"label\"/\"label\""], "no_match": ["value:'abc'/'xyz'", "value:'abc'/'abcabc'", "value:'?'/'?'", "value:'abc '/'abc'", "value:'abc'/' abc'", "value:'abc'/'abc/abc'", "value:'!!!'/'!!!'", "value:'ab'/'ab'", "value:'abc0'/'abc0'", "value:'000'/'000'", "value:'abc\"/'abc'", "value:'abc'/\"abc\"", "value:abc/abc", "!value:'abc'/'abc'", "value:'abc'/'abc'!", "value:'abc'/'abc'\n", "value:'abc'/'abc'\r", "value:'abc'/'abc'\r\n", "value:'abc'/'abc' ", "value:'abc'/'abc' ", " value:'abc'/'abc'", "value:'abc'/'abc' "]}}
{"id": "gpt-structured-data-18", "category": "structured-data", "difficulty": "hard", "description": "An LF-only data receipt has key= and 3 to 8 lowercase ASCII letters on line one, then copy= and the same key on line two. No final LF, additional punctuation or spaces. Both values must be enclosed in matching ASCII single or double quotes, using the same quote character on both lines. The quotes are delimiters, not part of the value; no escapes are permitted.", "regex": "/^key=(['\\\"])([a-z]{3,8})\\1\\ncopy=\\1\\2\\1$(?![\\s\\S])/", "tests": {"match": ["key='abc'\ncopy='abc'", "key=\"xyz\"\ncopy=\"xyz\"", "key='abcdefgh'\ncopy='abcdefgh'", "key=\"field\"\ncopy=\"field\"", "key='value'\ncopy='value'", "key=\"token\"\ncopy=\"token\"", "key='sample'\ncopy='sample'", "key=\"label\"\ncopy=\"label\""], "no_match": ["key='abc'\ncopy='xyz'", "key='abc\r'\ncopy='abc'", "key=abc copy=abc", "key=abc\nCopy=abc", "key='?'\ncopy='?'", "key='abc'\ncopy='abc '", "key='!!!'\ncopy='!!!'", "key='ab'\ncopy='ab'", "key='abc0'\ncopy='abc0'", "key='000'\ncopy='000'", "key='abc\"\ncopy='abc'", "key='abc'\ncopy=\"abc\"", "key=abc\ncopy=abc", "key='abc'\r\ncopy='abc'", "!key='abc'\ncopy='abc'", "key='abc'\ncopy='abc'!", "key='abc'\ncopy='abc'\n", "key='abc'\ncopy='abc'\r", "key='abc'\ncopy='abc'\r\n", "key='abc'\ncopy='abc' ", "key='abc'\ncopy='abc' ", " key='abc'\ncopy='abc'", "key='abc'\ncopy='abc' "]}}
